            <div xml:id="m-53c712c8-a236-4fc9-acc8-a7b7717dc864">
              <lg xml:id="m-e55036b8-5e94-414f-90b6-d89c40de7e5d">
                <l xml:id="m-7ca76144-d9cd-40d7-a590-4dd69bd6d2a0" facs="#m-3e33bf31-95fd-4b35-b56a-23d01be0899b" label="text-like">and Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-d3435950-dab7-4b0e-9365-6bbd79ef2b69" facs="#m-513f022f-a320-4a08-88ca-7b2ce9ffae48" label="ambiguous">231</l><l xml:id="m-50349b31-abd6-4f61-b528-6e91bf20911a" facs="#m-6977cf75-ef2b-478b-9441-5b8a49b11d75" label="lyrics-like">et ví- de jucun-di-tá- tem, quae véni¬ et</l><l xml:id="m-de02b8e2-f2a8-4950-ae28-d41536d100fe" facs="#m-c367eb8e-f69c-401f-b844-3d01a1c284f1" label="lyrics-like">tí¬</l><l xml:id="m-42c3b152-7ed4-4772-a200-924958d8d962" facs="#m-c893744a-5ac6-4866-a3eb-df06c348b71b" label="ambiguous">bi</l><l xml:id="m-a64baa7b-4b81-4671-8d3c-3f3442428eed" facs="#m-e0275be3-c0bb-4bc7-ab21-3c2e5dd9cb9e" label="lyrics-like">a Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-3778fa8e-f699-4557-a503-4d4744347521" facs="#m-d04defe9-e076-4130-a0ee-e4a3d4796b7f" label="lyrics-like">tú- o.</l><l xml:id="m-808b4d68-fd58-4270-b726-eff68198736c" facs="#m-75ef0a7e-c461-40da-a6ea-7237f37edcd7" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-3767a442-fd78-40d6-9dd5-6599bc0eae61" facs="#m-3d6f6572-384c-4589-9fc0-a4d05932a79e" label="lyrics-like">DEpléti cibo spirituális alimóniae, rii, dóceas nos terréna despicere, et</l><l xml:id="m-238fd76a-3ccf-4074-9bff-f8944bff463c" facs="#m-6c3a2cf5-37be-4895-8f70-d76527db7339" label="lyrics-like">1t súpplices te, Dómine, deprecá-amáre caeléstia. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-725073be-45ec-437f-847a-4770ca58f848" facs="#m-15b903f7-6d2c-4508-b70d-c1a2179ea9ef" label="lyrics-like">mur: ut hujus participatióne mysté¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ec844da-6bb0-4195-98ae-f48d3e4a339a" facs="#m-0e08ea97-4503-4d2d-a4ba-be7b36c21334" label="text-like">The other Postcommunions are as on the previous Sunday, p. 322.</l><l xml:id="m-5a7ff80e-b9f8-41cc-94f2-358e8a425520" facs="#m-93198939-9bfd-403a-b727-c2db23b61558" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-deec0aac-3ae7-4000-98fe-8438e1fcfcb0" facs="#m-4008398e-21f4-4727-b478-ccc11a3e646f" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ecce apparébit. p. 332.</l><l xml:id="m-5fada02b-8244-483d-b120-4c71b414058d" facs="#m-c3ce140d-d559-4f4a-afa7-9d318318e216" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-c1599f98-faaa-4f7c-a91f-d693916122ac" facs="#m-495122ff-7f59-4fc6-a4fa-bb130e04aeb5" label="ambiguous">Rom. 15</l><l xml:id="m-02b27897-cd06-4046-964d-526115a9f936" facs="#m-46c9f663-d4b8-469d-b510-d17adf78a606" label="lyrics-like">Eus autem patiéntiae et solátii stum :t ut unánimes uno ore hono¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a727763-9ae8-470a-9cc9-d5bec4580c91" facs="#m-a88a448c-0b0c-4cbf-9157-4704e2e7006f" label="lyrics-like">det vobis idipsum sápere in [rificétis Deum, * et Patrem Dómini</l><l xml:id="m-b246acb5-3c92-4315-bc01-7a12aa91fc09" facs="#m-1896cc58-35c0-40d6-abda-5a8e2bd23d28" label="lyrics-like">altérutrum secúndum Jesum Chri-] nostri Jesu Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-1420ce36-7364-4770-ad44-c447c111d09d" facs="#m-a2e03e53-4d11-4be5-b8e0-144a73775622" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Osténde nóbis Dómine. D. 243. V. Meménto nóstri.</l><l xml:id="m-4bd6a7a2-01a7-4265-a188-306d351e123b" facs="#m-5d8690b4-7bf3-4034-860f-1b3845bae28f" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-111208a7-12e8-4545-b0f5-016a1743bf38" facs="#m-d03f295e-d45b-4328-ba06-5ef248995eeb" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ecce Dóminus nóster. p. 333.</l><l xml:id="m-5614c68d-f6a3-4f8a-9e89-d41a6fe14450" facs="#m-b63152ca-bf22-47bf-ac99-a05582e17356" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-4701715a-9d3c-43ec-9313-04d49352bbbd" facs="#m-e9399166-eb58-463c-8ba1-a8e35665994b" label="ambiguous">Rom. 15. c.</l><l xml:id="m-8c7a468c-4c79-41f8-a623-9f7d64854c6e" facs="#m-6fdbe66f-ec6b-4f78-bc3e-c1e61ee2d3b5" label="lyrics-like">Eus autem spei répleat vos déndo:"ut abundétis in spe, et in</l><l xml:id="m-64f11794-a82d-4583-a7ec-30ea16c7827b" facs="#m-1e8b18c5-3df4-40e9-82cc-b837c9fbc504" label="lyrics-like">U omni gáudio et pace in cre- virtúte Spiritus Sancti.</l><l xml:id="m-a680e327-4547-42d7-82b1-b6220d08edd4" facs="#m-a2351b0b-5003-4005-ba53-3e07b4316f2f" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Super te Jerúsalem. p. 248. V. Véni Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-3c6e8870-b228-4d78-9083-8002e12f457e" facs="#m-94bd4d46-6434-4158-894b-7a41b41a366b" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-66e0fcfb-b9b5-40cc-bdd3-95f5ec1f9253" facs="#m-63e76672-0cec-487a-a6d6-796950516f78" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 1. g. p. 128.— 2. Confitébor. 7. d. p. 139.—</l><l xml:id="m-44076c0d-bc24-4bce-a5b0-5be54bd88b54" facs="#m-ca234f03-eadb-42fb-94a9-9276a1bb2204" label="lyrics-like">3. Beátus vir. 7. a. p. 146. — 4. Laudáte púeri. I. f p. 148. — 5. In</l><l xml:id="m-93dfa2ff-63d9-4f37-950b-3d4457af8143" facs="#m-0e1858d8-4ea0-4954-a3f9-dafb22f281d4" label="lyrics-like">éxitu. 3. a. p. 154.</l><l xml:id="m-bb89699e-31b2-47c8-b50f-67ee1a4b6d53" facs="#m-97e2d26d-ab8d-41fb-a97f-184514411785" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-533129d2-4d44-4d66-8f0f-78f0796c274d" facs="#m-d87ba4f2-3a8e-4c3c-b312-fa8331fa2c83" label="ambiguous">1.g</l><l xml:id="m-602c43c9-64c2-4f2f-a093-97de5fcd7599" facs="#m-3dbe8760-e597-479e-99d0-73609fb8e68b" label="lyrics-like">C-ce in núbibus caéli “Dóminus véni¬ et, cum</l><l xml:id="m-fcd46a8a-ca9c-4d9c-8bb0-c10755c9f3c7" facs="#m-a0ca9a08-c93c-4e9a-8cc4-95be69441bfa" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-5aad202f-0f49-4cc1-b58d-3c3ecac3fe5a" facs="#m-2800c10f-1202-4864-8baf-a4a2e991b645" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia</l><l xml:id="m-aefe06d3-bfb7-4a27-8a7b-e5f0aac7897a" facs="#m-4f54a225-2e27-4891-8aa0-b26e15045e8e" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-62fd389a-3ca2-4a5a-a1d0-35368cf71d9d" facs="#m-085eadcf-ccdc-4e66-b90a-016fac6c233d" label="lyrics-like">pot-está-te mágna,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
